    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/90a6574b1f9949c409464f6f3624b052.avif?t=1658257958\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/64650c8e7c9dc560de964e9eec296656.poster.avif?t=1658257958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/64650c8e7c9dc560de964e9eec296656.webm?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/64650c8e7c9dc560de964e9eec296656.mp4?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Homebound </strong><br>Homebound is a single-player survival game, where you have to build a base and defend it from the undead. Find a good location to set up camp and try to survive the waves of zombies that come your way! You have to find and craft resources to improve your base so you can survive the next night. Well trying to survive you have to figure out what happened to the world and what's up with all those dreadful robots!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/724d63f2695995ec1f704c6c4f00a9d5.poster.avif?t=1658257958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/724d63f2695995ec1f704c6c4f00a9d5.webm?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/724d63f2695995ec1f704c6c4f00a9d5.mp4?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Build a new home</strong><br>Defend your newfound home from the waves of zombies! you can loot buildings and use the resources you gathered to improve your base by building new walls, turrets and much more! Repair vehicles and bots to improve your chances of surviving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/0d10abae3855e87ef829772e6026510b.poster.avif?t=1658257958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/0d10abae3855e87ef829772e6026510b.webm?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/0d10abae3855e87ef829772e6026510b.mp4?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/90a6574b1f9949c409464f6f3624b052.avif?t=1658257958\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/64650c8e7c9dc560de964e9eec296656.poster.avif?t=1658257958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/64650c8e7c9dc560de964e9eec296656.webm?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/64650c8e7c9dc560de964e9eec296656.mp4?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Homebound </strong><br>Homebound is a single-player survival game, where you have to build a base and defend it from the undead. Find a good location to set up camp and try to survive the waves of zombies that come your way! You have to find and craft resources to improve your base so you can survive the next night. Well trying to survive you have to figure out what happened to the world and what's up with all those dreadful robots!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/724d63f2695995ec1f704c6c4f00a9d5.poster.avif?t=1658257958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/724d63f2695995ec1f704c6c4f00a9d5.webm?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/724d63f2695995ec1f704c6c4f00a9d5.mp4?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Build a new home</strong><br>Defend your newfound home from the waves of zombies! you can loot buildings and use the resources you gathered to improve your base by building new walls, turrets and much more! Repair vehicles and bots to improve your chances of surviving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/0d10abae3855e87ef829772e6026510b.poster.avif?t=1658257958\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/0d10abae3855e87ef829772e6026510b.webm?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1908610/extras/0d10abae3855e87ef829772e6026510b.mp4?t=1658257958\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
